
### gitlab-provider
$ ./bin/fm-pr-merge.sh task-x1 https://gitlab.example/group/project/-/merge_requests/7 --allow-unstarted-actions
error: --allow-unstarted-actions applies only to GitHub
exit=2

### forgejo-provider
$ ./bin/fm-pr-merge.sh task-x1 https://forgejo.example/group/project/pulls/9 --allow-unstarted-actions
error: --allow-unstarted-actions applies only to GitHub
exit=2

### github-mutual-exclusion
$ ./bin/fm-pr-merge.sh task-x1 https://github.com/example/project/pull/121 --allow-unstarted-actions --allow-red ci
error: --allow-unstarted-actions and --allow-red cannot be combined
exit=2
